+**Input**: Feature specification from `/specs/001-summary-output/spec.md`
+
+## Summary
+
+Add a one-line summary output (`renderSummary()` function and `--summary` CLI flag) to frai-gate's `check` command for CI log consumption. The summary format is `<VERDICT> <answered>/7` with optional `: <check_ids>` for failures. Exit codes remain unchanged (1 for BLOCK, 0 otherwise); `--json` takes precedence if both flags are given.
+
